{
  "_comment": "The Reports page's export columns, per report type. The server-side PDF and CSV exports (app/services/report_tables.py) are built from this file, and frontend/src/modules/reports/exportColumnsParity.test.ts fails if a renderer's get<X>ExportData columns or a report card's title stop matching it. Change both sides together. 'rows' names the result key holding the table's records; 'dynamic' marks columns appended per result (call volume's call types).",
